::meta
title: Procedure traversal index
version: 1.0.0
updated: 2026-11-14
domain: procedure|orchestration
scope: all
governs: procedure.md
::end

::schema
node-types: [route, assertion, meta]
edge-types: [requires, precedes, see-also]
scope-levels: [all, agent, orchestrator]
::end

::index
# id | type | scope | keywords
banner | meta | all | disclaimer, academic, research
spec | route | all | axioms, format, pro
group | route | all | V4, toggle, inverse, word
grammar | route | all | ebnf, ill-formed
loop | route | all | sense, process, act, admission
sheaf | route | all | restrict, glue, adapt
fixture | route | all | CAL-1937-001, water, versions
falsify | route | all | challenges, traces
stop | assertion | all | current version, one transform
__changelog | meta | all | version
::end

::node [id=banner type=meta scope=all entry=true skip-if-known=true]
::dense
academic | research | licensed oversight | banner
::warning
Read DISCLAIMER before any node.
::end
::edges
->[:precedes] spec
->[:see-also] DISCLAIMER
::end
::end

::node [id=spec type=route scope=all]
::dense
axioms | graph | robotic | synthetic | version
::full
Open procedure.md at the axioms. The media type is text/vnd.pro+markdown.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#1-axioms
->[:see-also] group
->[:see-also] grammar
->[:see-also] loop
->[:see-also] sheaf
::end
::end

::node [id=group type=route scope=all]
::dense
Klein four-group | right action | inverse | word
::full
Open the rewrite group. Identity is a read. toggle-a and toggle-b are involutions and they commute.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#3-rewrite-group
::end
::end

::node [id=grammar type=route scope=all]
::dense
ebnf | no sequence attribute | ill-formed
::full
Open the grammar before parsing a .pro file.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#4-grammar
::end
::end

::node [id=loop type=route scope=all]
::dense
invent-auto-procedure | one admission | read or write
::full
Open the realtime loop for a stable environment. One proposal. One transform.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#5-realtime-loop
->[:precedes] stop
::end
::end

::node [id=sheaf type=route scope=all]
::dense
adapt-procedure-locally | restrict | glue | preempt
::full
Open local adaptation when open, constraints, or operators differ.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#6-local-adaptation
::end
::end

::node [id=fixture type=route scope=all]
::dense
CAL-1937-001 | ver-2 current | water | open a
::full
Open the fixture. The current version is ver-2. Slots stay water.
::end
::warning
Act returns a specification. It does not command hardware.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] examples/cal-1937-001.pro
->[:see-also] procedure.md#7-fixture
::end
::end

::node [id=falsify type=route scope=all]
::dense
equal bits | traces differ | orchestrator | heartbeat
::full
Open falsification before treating two chains as the same specification.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] procedure.md#12-falsification
::end
::end

::node [id=stop type=assertion scope=all]
::dense
current version | one transform | warning kept
::assertion
trigger: after [loop]
check: one admission and DISCLAIMER read
on-pass: ->[:proceed] fixture
on-fail: ->[:escalate] banner
::end
::end

::node [id=__changelog type=meta scope=all]
::changelog
2026-11-14|added|procedure traversal index|format 1.0.0
::end
::end
